<title>USA: Verilink says names John Batty CFO.</title>
<headline>Verilink says names John Batty CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Verilink Corp said Wednesday John Batty has joined the company as vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said Batty was most recently vice president and treasurer at VLSI Technology Inc.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately able to provide further information.</p>
